linux-thermal-control (0.5.8-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Pre-authorize active local desktop sessions through the installed Polkit
    action so routine fan-mode and curve changes do not request a password.
  * Continue denying inactive and remote sessions from changing hardware state.
  * Add package-policy regression checks and document the authorization scope.

